      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Du Xunhe",
      "wikidata_id": "Q712788"
    },
    "title": "讀諸家詩",
    "poem": [
      "辭賦文章能者稀，難中難者莫過詩。",
      "直應吟骨無生死，秪我前身是阿誰。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_693_007_01",
    "volume": 693,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "杜荀鶴",
