      "period": "Late Tang",
      "english_name": "Du Xunhe",
      "wikidata_id": "Q712788"
    },
    "title": "蠶婦",
    "poem": [
      "粉色全無飢色加，豈知人世有榮華。",
      "年年道我蠶辛苦，底事渾身著苧麻。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_693_012_01",
    "volume": 693,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "杜荀鶴",
      "recorded": "杜荀鶴",
